{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/izzzi-life-mint-orangelife-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":311,"crm_id":"2360","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Izzzi Life Mint","slug":"izzzi-life-mint-orangelife-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Orange.Life","price":594118,"display_price":"594k","lattitude":25.0470423,"longitude":55.1980745,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Izzzi Life Mint is a modern five-storey apartment complex located in the dynamic Jumeirah Village Circle area of Dubai.</p><p>This stylish house from the developer DMS offers a choice of luxury apartments:<strong> studios, one-bedroom and two-bedroom apartments.</strong> Izzzi Life Mint is distinguished by its unique architectural forms and refined design, which makes it stand out from other residential complexes.</p><p>In total, the complex offers 115 apartments of three categories: for one person or a couple, as well as spacious apartments for families with children. The interior of the apartment is designed with special attention to detail to ensure maximum comfort and aesthetic pleasure. Each apartment has a balcony or terrace.</p><p>Residents of the complex can use the services of an extensive internal infrastructure, including shops, cafes and green areas for recreation. Near the complex there is a transport interchange, which makes it easy to get to any point of the city or airport, both by private and public transport. Residents are also provided with a 24-hour reception, underground parking, security, a swimming pool, a children's pool, a sports hall, an open-air cinema, coworking and games areas, as well as a closed territory.</p><p>Various infrastructure facilities are located in the immediate vicinity of the complex. Trade Centre Metro Station is a 5-minute walk away, while Museum of the Future and Al Satwa Park are a 10 — minute walk away. La Mer Beach is 15 minutes ' walk away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2360/images/2024/06/27/5fIEgUWEaTM9emJ7W2DJtzn1yAFBKmYeUBpPwV8R.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/27/5fIEgUWEaTM9emJ7W2DJtzn1yAFBKmYeUBpPwV8R.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2360/images/2024/06/27/NZ43mqv5sPKJcK5g7FDhRSePVeiKzJhmn8B5O0Rx.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/27/NZ43mqv5sPKJcK5g7FDhRSePVeiKzJhmn8B5O0Rx.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2360/images/2024/06/27/IEd8OJyxZTkuqkySSOEkVOplqWJfGZmIceNCKYnm.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/27/IEd8OJyxZTkuqkySSOEkVOplqWJfGZmIceNCKYnm.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2354,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1592,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1741,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1742,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1743,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":7385,"title":"20%","description":"On the booking"},{"id":7386,"title":"20%","description":"In 3 month"},{"id":7387,"title":"20%","description":"In 6 month"},{"id